        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "parts": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "## Sorted by size\n\nUse `ls` with **-S**:\n\n```sh\nls -lS\n```\n\n- `-l` long format\n- `-S` sort by size, largest first\n\n> Add `-r` to reverse."
            }
          ],
          "at": 1790362802000,
          "key": 593
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "parts": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "And recursively?"
            }
          ],
          "at": 1790362803000,
          "key": 1124
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "parts": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Use `find` with `du`:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "```sh\nfind . -type f -exec du -h {} + | sort -rh | head\n```"
            }
          ],
